# =============================================================================
# Bright OS — Android Application Support (Bright Android)
#
# Waydroid-based Android runtime. Activation is session-based (started by the
# user from bright-android, NOT at boot).
# Target: Debian 13 (Trixie) amd64
#
# Notes on Trixie package availability (Phase 6.3 corrective):
#   - Trixie kernel 6.12 ships CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_IPC=y (built-in), so
#     binder-linux-module-dkms is no longer needed.
#   - waydroid is NOT in Debian Trixie main as of Trixie release; it must be
#     installed from the Waydroid repo by the user via bright-android init.
#     We keep adb/fastboot/wl-clipboard so CLI tooling is present; the
#     bright-android wrapper will offer to install waydroid from its repo
#     on first run.
# =============================================================================

# ADB / fastboot
adb
fastboot

# Clipboard integration for Wayland (used by Waydroid clipboard sync)
wl-clipboard
